sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Web as Web Server
    participant DB as Database

    User->>Web: Request login page
    activate Web
    Web-->>User: Display login form
    deactivate Web

    User->>Web: Submit credentials (username/password)
    activate Web
    Web->>DB: Query user record
    activate DB
    DB-->>Web: Return user data
    deactivate DB

    alt Valid Credentials
        Web-->>User: Login successful & redirect
    else Invalid Credentials
        Web-->>User: Show error message
    end
    deactivate Web

